  "description": "⭐<em>Don't just watch the film. </em><strong><em>Taste it.</em></strong><br>\r\n<em>A bespoke cinematic dining experience where iconic film moments come straight to your table as they appear on screen,&nbsp;course by delicious course.</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🎥 Don’t just watch the film… savour it!<br>\r\n🧙 Enjoy a multi-course menu inspired by the film Hocus Pocus (1993)<br>\r\n🍴 Dine in sync with iconic on-screen moments<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date: October &amp; November 2026<br>\r\n🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.<br>\r\n📍 Location: The Refinery Citypoint, EC2Y 9HT<br>\r\n👤 Age rating: this film is rated <a href=\"https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/hocus-pocus-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc00otg3nza\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PG</a> (min age 5)<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: this venue is wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JTeTzvmOpxv2WyfA5TcAsXMvIJ1t3Zhs/view?usp=drive_link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\r\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSp2K6XG_QIZ2Gg_zrZb2xW9_xXjZJUPTPFAstXgmSUJavlcRlINfSLSKiSYT1VBfylMThAsmy0Fqjs/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nTrick or treat, witches... dinner is served!<br>\r\n<br>\r\nStep into Taste Film for an immersive cinematic dining experience, where every course arrives in perfect sync with Hocus Pocus.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nCalling all witches, ghouls and anyone who still thinks Halloween is the best night of the year. Expect pumpkin-spiced popcorn, spellbinding cocktails, smashed pumpkin fritters, smoky barbecue ribs, graveyard greens and a dangerously delicious pecan pie finale, all inspired by the iconic moments, mischief and magic of our favourite sisters.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nEvery dish has been crafted to bring the world of Hocus Pocus to life, think cosy autumn movie nights dialed up with 90s nostalgia to witchy potions, theatrical twists and just the right amount of chaos.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWhether you grew up watching every Halloween, still know every line by heart, or you're discovering the magic for the first time, this is the ultimate way to experience Hocus Pocus.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nGrab your coven, dust off your best costume and join us for a Halloween night of high camp, spooky surprises and a little bit of magic.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBook now… before the sun rises and the tickets turn to dust.",
